{"prefectureId":"03","cities":{"03201":[{"id":"03201:national:2f66327a55c6","cityId":"03201","category":"地理・自然","text":"市内中心部で主流北上川に雫石川、中津川が合流する。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E7%9B%9B%E5%B2%A1%E5%B8%82&oldid=111405336"},{"id":"03201:national:7fee30e9130b","cityId":"03201","category":"地域","text":"盛岡市は、岩手県中央部に位置する市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E7%9B%9B%E5%B2%A1%E5%B8%82&oldid=111405336"}],"03202":[{"id":"03202:national:2987251cb64c","cityId":"03202","category":"地理・自然","text":"市域中央部を西から東に閉伊川が貫流し、市街地のある宮古湾へと注いでいます。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%AE%AE%E5%8F%A4%E5%B8%82&oldid=110814081"},{"id":"03202:national:b22e9a438e0f","cityId":"03202","category":"地理・自然","text":"市の南東部から北に向かって津軽石川が流れ、宮古湾に注いでいます。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%AE%AE%E5%8F%A4%E5%B8%82&oldid=110814081"},{"id":"03202:national:6ffa86ab2f2e","cityId":"03202","category":"地域","text":"宮古市は、岩手県の三陸海岸に面する市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%AE%AE%E5%8F%A4%E5%B8%82&oldid=110814081"}],"03203":[{"id":"03203:national:9510d9e47b3d","cityId":"03203","category":"地理・自然","text":"大船渡市には鷹生川が流れています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%A4%A7%E8%88%B9%E6%B8%A1%E5%B8%82&oldid=111240163"},{"id":"03203:national:ba7d7ffbcb99","cityId":"03203","category":"地理・自然","text":"大船渡市には吉浜川が流れています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%A4%A7%E8%88%B9%E6%B8%A1%E5%B8%82&oldid=111240163"},{"id":"03203:national:6429d55f47dd","cityId":"03203","category":"地域","text":"大船渡市は、岩手県南東部の太平洋沿岸地域に所在する市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%A4%A7%E8%88%B9%E6%B8%A1%E5%B8%82&oldid=111240163"}],"03205":[{"id":"03205:national:0f719c023bb7","cityId":"03205","category":"地理・自然","text":"花巻市には北上川が流れています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%8A%B1%E5%B7%BB%E5%B8%82&oldid=111406570"},{"id":"03205:national:6aeec8d892e9","cityId":"03205","category":"地理・自然","text":"花巻市には豊沢川が流れています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%8A%B1%E5%B7%BB%E5%B8%82&oldid=111406570"},{"id":"03205:national:1d1ad149052f","cityId":"03205","category":"地域","text":"花巻市は、岩手県の中西部に位置する市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%8A%B1%E5%B7%BB%E5%B8%82&oldid=111406570"},{"id":"03205:national:48da476db6f6","cityId":"03205","category":"地域","text":"市域の中央に北上平野が広がり、西に奥羽山脈、東に北上高地が位置する。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%8A%B1%E5%B7%BB%E5%B8%82&oldid=111406570"}],"03206":[{"id":"03206:national:1b808b31b75e","cityId":"03206","category":"地域","text":"北上市は、岩手県南西部にある市で、県南広域振興圏に位置する。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%8C%97%E4%B8%8A%E5%B8%82&oldid=111085000"}],"03207":[{"id":"03207:national:07d976157d0c","cityId":"03207","category":"地理・自然","text":"久慈市には遠島山があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E4%B9%85%E6%85%88%E5%B8%82&oldid=111036513"},{"id":"03207:national:8a2f7db90830","cityId":"03207","category":"地理・自然","text":"久慈市には深田金山があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E4%B9%85%E6%85%88%E5%B8%82&oldid=111036513"},{"id":"03207:national:543fa9e83a4e","cityId":"03207","category":"地域","text":"久慈市は、岩手県北東部に位置する市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E4%B9%85%E6%85%88%E5%B8%82&oldid=111036513"},{"id":"03207:national:4b1bdee9753c","cityId":"03207","category":"地域","text":"市の中心部は久慈湾の奥部にあります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E4%B9%85%E6%85%88%E5%B8%82&oldid=111036513"}],"03208":[{"id":"03208:national:c076996a9706","cityId":"03208","category":"文化・名所","text":"「綾織新田遺跡」は国指定の史跡です。","source":"https://kunishitei.bunka.go.jp/heritage/detail/401/3344"},{"id":"03208:national:45c0c1961539","cityId":"03208","category":"文化・名所","text":"市の公式キャラクターは、「カリンちゃん」および「くるりんちゃん」です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%81%A0%E9%87%8E%E5%B8%82&oldid=110164508"},{"id":"03208:national:9f992e763b1d","cityId":"03208","