自然","text":"金ケ崎町には北上川が流れています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%87%91%E3%82%B1%E5%B4%8E%E7%94%BA&oldid=110442165"},{"id":"03381:national:71caff7c710e","cityId":"03381","category":"地理・自然","text":"金ケ崎町には胆沢川が流れています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%87%91%E3%82%B1%E5%B4%8E%E7%94%BA&oldid=110442165"},{"id":"03381:national:f227ee4cb225","cityId":"03381","category":"地域","text":"金ケ崎町は、岩手県南西内陸部の胆沢郡に属する町です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%87%91%E3%82%B1%E5%B4%8E%E7%94%BA&oldid=110442165"}],"03402":[{"id":"03402:national:ef5aa30548f1","cityId":"03402","category":"地理・自然","text":"町の中央が北上盆地の一部を成しており、北上川が南流して氾濫原を形成しています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%B9%B3%E6%B3%89%E7%94%BA&oldid=111133926"},{"id":"03402:national:1a04ecb28059","cityId":"03402","category":"地域","text":"平泉町は岩手県南西部にある町です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%B9%B3%E6%B3%89%E7%94%BA&oldid=111133926"}],"03441":[{"id":"03441:national:5c5ef402a8c7","cityId":"03441","category":"地域","text":"住田町は、岩手県東南部に位置する気仙郡の町です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E4%BD%8F%E7%94%B0%E7%94%BA&oldid=110266185"}],"03461":[{"id":"03461:national:3e7fbb55aa67","cityId":"03461","category":"地域","text":"大槌町は、岩手県上閉伊郡に所在する町です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%A4%A7%E6%A7%8C%E7%94%BA&oldid=111030977"}],"03482":[{"id":"03482:national:ab26927adc48","cityId":"03482","category":"地理・自然","text":"町の西端は高滝森で、西部一帯は、津軽石川の上流部の流域となっています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%B1%B1%E7%94%B0%E7%94%BA&oldid=111080464"},{"id":"03482:national:d37e888c4656","cityId":"03482","category":"地域","text":"山田町は、岩手県沿岸中部の三陸地方に位置する、太平洋に面する町です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%B1%B1%E7%94%B0%E7%94%BA&oldid=111080464"}],"03483":[{"id":"03483:national:531ec47854e1","cityId":"03483","category":"文化・名所","text":"「安家洞」は国指定の天然記念物です。","source":"https://kunishitei.bunka.go.jp/heritage/detail/401/161"},{"id":"03483:national:914b66e69a13","cityId":"03483","category":"地理・自然","text":"岩泉町には宇霊羅山があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%B2%A9%E6%B3%89%E7%94%BA&oldid=110583503"},{"id":"03483:national:04544ee56e45","cityId":"03483","category":"地理・自然","text":"岩泉町には堺ノ神岳があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%B2%A9%E6%B3%89%E7%94%BA&oldid=110583503"},{"id":"03483:national:cbda99d647e8","cityId":"03483","category":"地域","text":"岩泉町は、岩手県の中央部から東部に位置する町です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%B2%A9%E6%B3%89%E7%94%BA&oldid=110583503"},{"id":"03483:national:2c697f966f70","cityId":"03483","category":"地域","text":"町内各地で水が湧いており、「水の郷百選」の選定を受けています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%B2%A9%E6%B3%89%E7%94%BA&oldid=110583503"}],"03484":[{"id":"03484:national:eccf0dd8f1b9","cityId":"03484","category":"地域","text":"田野畑村は、日本の岩手県沿岸北部に位置する下閉伊郡に属する村です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E7%94%B0%E9%87%8E%E7%95%91%E6%9D%91&oldid=109714507"}],"03485":[{"id":"03485:national:219440984d12","cityId":"03485","category":"地域","text":"普代村は、岩手県にある太平洋に面した村であり、北緯40度線上世界最東端の地です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%99%AE%E4%BB%A3%E6%9D%91&oldid=109791990"}],"03501":[{"id":"03501:national:49f821db1755","cityId":"03501","category":"地理・自然","text":"軽米町は、北上山地の北端にあります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%BB%BD%E7%B1%B3%E7%94%BA&oldid=110871836"},{"id":"03501:national:f53d569ef89b","cityId":"03501","category":"地域","text":"軽米町は、岩手県の北部に位置する町です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%BB%BD%E7%B1%B3%E7%94%BA&oldid=110871836"}],"03503":[{"id":"03503:national:f5e7ef0c52be","cityId":"03503","category":"地理・自然","text":"野田村には男和佐羅比山があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%87%8E%E7%94%B0%E6%9D%91&oldid=108282485"},{"id":"03503:national:b3fd21dbae7d","cityId":"03503","category":"地理・自然","text":"野田村には安家川が流れています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%87%8E%E7%94%B0%E6%9D%91&oldid=108282485"},{"id":"03503:national:b73ff8aa3c8e","cityId":"03503","category":"地域","text":"野田村は、岩手県九戸郡に属している太平洋に面した村です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%87%8E%E7%94%B0%E6%9D%91&oldid=108282485"}],"03506":[{"id":"03506:national:754c5fb43ff7","cityId":"03506","category":"地域","text":"九戸村は、岩手県の北部に位置する村です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E4%B9%9D%E6%88%B8%E6%9D%91&oldid=110163445"}],"03507":[{"id":"03507:national:bf0209eaf61a","cityId":"03507","category":"地理・自然","text":"洋野町には久慈平岳があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%B4%8B%E9%87%8E%E7%94%BA&oldid=109794986"},{"id":"03507:national:1d72a1e9695f","cityId":"03507","category":"地理・自然","text":"洋野町には川尻川が流れています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%B4%8B%E9%87%8E%E7%94%BA&oldid=109794986"},{"id":"03507:national:729c02711896","cityId":"03507","category":"地域","text":"洋野町は、岩手県沿岸部最北端の町です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%B4%8B%E9%87%8E%E7%94%BA&oldid=109794986"}],"03524":[{"id":"03524:national:8a59e69bdfda","cityId":"03524","category":"文化・名所","text":"「姉帯小鳥谷根反の珪化木地帯」は国指定の天然記念物です。","source":"https://kunishitei.bunka.go.jp/heritage/detail/401/150"},{"id":"03524:national:3961ebcabf3a","cityId":"03524","category":"地域","text":"一戸町は、岩手県二戸郡に属する町です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E4%B8%80%E6%88%B8%E7%94%BA&oldid=109791671"}]}}
